						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-J&nbsp;guesses</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-419-j">SCP-419-J</a>? (the black man who warns Iris about the demon's circle)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1333-j">SCP-1333-J!</a> (THE SCREAMING MAN!)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2000-j">SCP-2000-J</a> (Duncan, Jerry's cellmate)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-butt-j">SCP-2001-J</a>? (glowing poop?)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2383-j">SCP-2383-J</a> or <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1417-j">SCP-1417-J</a>? (Greenberg's lab?)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2558-j">SCP-2558-J</a>-ex (exploding kittens)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4357-j">SCP-4357-J</a> (the devil's circle)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5040-j">SCP-5040-J</a> (the silent man/mime)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5308-j">SCP-5308-J</a>-5 (Jerry)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-7475-j">SCP-7475-J</a>? (Rodriguez?)<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-7560-j">SCP-7560-J</a> (Mr. Decray)</p> </div> </div> </div> 
