					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1196947#post-2295061</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1196947/no-joke#post-2295061</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2015 22:00:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>sirpudding</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>348648</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>No, you don't capitalize &quot;min&quot; which is what it is replacing. Lowercase &quot;mike&quot; is correct. It's there because &quot;minutes&quot; a long word with soft consonants that gets garbled in bad radio transmissions. &quot;Mike&quot; is a short word with a hard consonant that is more clearly transmitted. It is jargon, not slang (you can't use slang on the radio according to military regulations).</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
